const menus=[['获客','创作中心','creation','◧'],['','视频粗剪','video','▷'],['','发布与数据','publishing','▤'],['','评论与私信','messages','☏'],['销售','客户工作台','customers','◫'],['','方案测算','planner','▥'],['','待办中心','tasks','☷'],['知识与改进','产品与活动','knowledge','▣'],['','经验复盘','reviews','◇']];
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(state));}catch{toast('浏览器本地存储不可用。');}if(connection.local)fetch('/api/state',{method:'PUT',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(state)}).catch(()=>{});}
function toast(text){const el=$('#toast');el.textContent=text;el.classList.add('visible');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('visible'),3600);}
function tag(text,color=''){return `<span class="tag ${color}">${escapeHTML(text)}</span>`;}
function button(label,action,cls='',extra=''){return `<button class="btn ${cls}" data-action="${action}" ${extra}>${label}</button>`;}
function header(title,description,action=''){return `<div class="page-heading"><div><h1>${title}</h1><p>${description}</p></div><div class="actions">${action}</div></div>`;}
function current(){return state.customers.find(c=>c.id===selected)||state.customers[0];}
function stageColor(stage){return ({'高意向':'blue','人工处理':'red','已购服务':'green','长期跟进':'orange'})[stage]||'';}
function navigate(next){view=next;render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});}
function renderVideoOnline(){return header('视频粗剪','上传短视频、找停顿、人工确认删减并导出。',tag('浏览器本地处理','green'))+'<iframe id="video-editor-frame" class="editor-frame" src="video-editor.html" title="视频粗剪编辑器" loading="eager" allow="autoplay"></iframe>';}
function render(){
 activateScheduledProduct();
 $('#navigation').innerHTML=menus.map(([group,label,id,icon])=>`${group?`<div class="nav-group">${group}</div>`:''}<button class="nav-item ${view===id?'active':''}" data-view="${id}"><span aria-hidden="true">${icon}</span>${label}${id==='tasks'?`<b class="nav-count">${typeof salesReviewPendingCount==='function'?salesReviewPendingCount():state.tasks.filter(t=>!t.done).length}</b>`:''}</button>`).join('');
 const name=menus.find(m=>m[2]===view)?.[1]||'连接与设置';$('#breadcrumb').textContent=`工作台 / ${name}`;
 const screens={customers:renderCustomers,planner:renderPlanner,creation:renderCreation,video:renderVideoOnline,publishing:renderPublishing,messages:renderMessages,tasks:renderTasks,knowledge:renderKnowledge,reviews:renderReviews,settings:renderSettings};
 $('#main').innerHTML=(screens[view]||renderCustomers)();
 updateConnectionNotice();
}
function updateConnectionNotice(){const el=$('#connection-notice'),storage=$('#storage-note');if(storage)storage.textContent=connection.local?'模拟数据 · 本机后端保存':'模拟数据 · 仅本浏览器保存';if(!el)return;if(!connection.checked){el.textContent='正在检查本地 AI 连接。回复不会自动发送或发布。';return;}if(connection.local&&connection.difyConfigured){el.textContent='Dify 调用已配置；是否实际生成以本次草稿状态为准。回复仍需人工确认，不会自动发送。';return;}if(connection.local){el.textContent='本地后端已启动，但尚未配置 Dify 应用密钥。';return;}el.textContent='当前为公开演示模式：未接入 Dify，回复使用固定安全模板。';}
window.addEventListener('message',event=>{if(event.origin!==location.origin||event.data?.type!=='video-editor-height')return;const frame=$('#video-editor-frame');if(frame&&frame.contentWindow===event.source&&Number.isFinite(event.data.height))frame.style.height=Math.max(850,Math.min(2800,event.data.height+8))+'px';});
